"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDc3NjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3447762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny","html_url":"https://github.com/samjanny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-22T16:57:01Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T16:57:01Z","body":"> Is there an issue created for this?\r\n\r\nYes, #102164 and #109624 appear related. #102164 is especially relevant because it bisects the regression to a3525bc / #99538. #109624 also reports 4.4-only edge artifacts that disappear with zero bounces.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5780553925/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5780893971","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123713#issuecomment-5780893971","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123713","id":5780893971,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWJFxEw","user":{"login":"clayjohn","id":16521339,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NTIxMzM5","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16521339?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn","html_url":"https://github.com/clayjohn","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/clayjohn/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-22T17:21:52Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T17:21:52Z","body":"All of those bug reports are already closed. \r\n\r\nDoes this fix any actual bugs in the engine?","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5780893971/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5781242883","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123713#issuecomment-5781242883","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123713","id":5781242883,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWJbEAw","user":{"login":"samjanny","id":3447762,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM0NDc3NjI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3447762?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny","html_url":"https://github.com/samjanny","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/samjanny/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-22T17:47:09Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T17:47:09Z","body":"> All of those bug reports are already closed.\r\n> \r\n> Does this fix any actual bugs in the engine?\r\n\r\nYes. The older reports are only references for similar symptoms; this PR does not depend on them.\r\n\r\nI reproduced the bug independently in the LightmapGI baker on current master (e2b42469) with a minimal synthetic scene.\r\n\r\nWhen baking an opaque CULL_DISABLED closed volume, texels inside the geometry receive substantial indirect light that they cannot physically see. With a white sky, the buried region measures about 0.79 L0 on master, compared with 0.024 with this fix, 0.008 on 4.3, and 0.006 in the equivalent CULL_BACK control.\r\n\r\nThe cause is in the bake ray tracing path: trace_ray() applies the material cull mode before returning the hit side. For CULL_DISABLED, a geometric back-face hit is therefore reported as RAY_FRONT.\r\n\r\nDuring baking, this has two effects:\r\n\r\n- the unocclude pass can no longer recognize that a texel lies inside geometry;\r\n- indirect bounce rays shade an inside hit using the outer-facing side of the triangle, so the bounce can leave the volume and collect sky light.\r\n\r\nThe result is incorrect baked indirect lighting on buried texels and geometric junctions. This affects actual double-sided opaque materials, including glTF materials imported with doubleSided.\r\n\r\nI also tested the transparency behavior introduced by #99538 separately. Transparent glass, colored glass, and two transparent surfaces in sequence produce bit-identical baked output between master and this fix. Alpha/cutout transmission is preserved as well.\r\n\r\nI can provide the minimal synthetic bake repro if that would help with review.","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5781242883/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5782349042","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/123713#issuecomment-5782349042","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123713","id":5782349042,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABWKek8g","user":{"login":"jcostello","id":1168582,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNjg1ODI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1168582?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello","html_url":"https://github.com/jcostello","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jcostello/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-22T19:06:40Z","updated_at":"2026-09-22T19:06:40Z","body":"The best thing you can do is to create an issue with your findings in master, clear details and a MRP to reproduce the issue","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https